From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 21:06:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Eturlia: getDistanceManager returns package DistanceManager

Inner class rename to ChunkMap$DistanceManager shadowed the return
type of getDistanceManager(), so ServerLevel invoked
ChunkMap$DistanceManager.inEntityTickingRange and Sable's WrapOperation
targeting DistanceManager missed. Qualify the return type.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
index 48931193a5cbda08bb8df78d4d02f2ecec3ef0f2..19e5bcb37d9746726ba5983c4d1819f745a1b2e6 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
@@ -622,7 +622,9 @@ public class ChunkMap extends ChunkStorage implements ChunkHolder.PlayerProvider
         return ca.spottedleaf.moonrise.common.util.ChunkSystem.getVisibleChunkHolderCount(this.level); // Paper
     }
 
-    public DistanceManager getDistanceManager() {
+    // Eturlia: must return package DistanceManager (not ChunkMap$DistanceManager) so ServerLevel
+    // bytecode keeps INVOKEVIRTUAL DistanceManager.inEntityTickingRange for Sable WrapOperation.
+    public net.minecraft.server.level.DistanceManager getDistanceManager() {
         return this.distanceManager;
     }
 
